{"id":"n24862-1-8","stage":2,"title":"참석자 · 参加者","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24862-1-8-1","ko":"어제 신제품 홍보 행사에 갔었니?","zh":"昨天你去参加新产品宣传活动了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신제품","meaning":"新产品","explanation":"신제품：新产品","readings":[{"term":"신제품","audio":"/audio/88654a37295045f57a46.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14072","senseId":"1","lemma":"신제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"홍보","meaning":"宣传","explanation":"홍보：宣传","readings":[{"term":"홍보","audio":"/audio/e1594a102757fad56ab7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87628","senseId":"1","lemma":"홍보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행사에","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔었니?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"88654a37295045f5","term":"신제품","zh":"新产品","audio":"/audio/88654a37295045f57a46.mp3","entryId":"14072","definition":"新制造的产品。","pronunciation":["신제품"]},{"id":"e1594a102757fad5","term":"홍보","zh":"宣传","audio":"/audio/e1594a102757fad56ab7.mp3","entryId":"87628","definition":"广而告之；或指该消息。","pronunciation":["홍보"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2